---
import { SITE_TITLE, AUTHOR_NAME } from '../consts';
const today = new Date();
---

<footer>
	<div class="footer-content">
		<p class="copyright">
			&copy; {today.getFullYear()} {AUTHOR_NAME}. <strong>{SITE_TITLE}</strong>. All rights reserved.
		</p>
		<p class="footer-tagline">
			코드 작성자를 넘어, 프로덕트와 AI를 리드하는 엔지니어로 성장하는 기록.
		</p>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	footer {
		padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
		background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
		color: var(--text-muted);
		text-align: center;
		margin-top: auto;
	}

	.footer-content {
		max-width: 860px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.copyright {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
	}

	.footer-tagline {
		margin: 0.5rem 0 0 0;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}
</style>

